 "description": "The EXPLR 10 Sport + is one of XO’s best-selling models. With its sea-keeping performance, striking design and year round comfort, this boat is ready for comfortable weekends away. EXPLR 10 S+ has convertible saloon/sleeping berth, with the optional toilet and galley module.",
 "credits": [],
