   "id": null,
   "title": "Gather your group & go!",
   "intro": "8-10 people can travel through the wind and navigate steadily with comfort. The front cabin accommodates two people for a good night sleep, hence the inevitable night after a day is not an obstacle for continuing the adventure.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "For families & friends",
   "intro": "The EXPLR 10 Sport + is fit for families and friends appreciating a day offshore. Spending quality time with close ones is important, so therefore this boat is equipped to bring comfort also during shorter adventures.\nInspired by Nordic environment and conditions, with its accommodation capacities and weatherproof cover, EXPLR 10 S+ is full of speed and style for the adventurers and families travelling across planet. The boat can be installed with air-conditioning and heater, and like all our boats, it also features our renowned aluminium deep-V hull.",
